---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Preview Terms · SoyaOS Developer Portal">
  <article class="max-w-3xl">
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-soya-accent">Public Preview</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Preview terms</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-soya-ink/70">
      Effective August 20, 2026. SoyaOS Cloud Public Preview is a free,
      single-region, best-effort evaluation service with no SLA.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-7 text-sm leading-6 text-soya-ink/70">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-soya-ink">Acceptable use</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">Use the service only for lawful text-agent evaluation. Do not probe other tenants, evade quotas, distribute credentials, overload the service, or submit malware, exploit instructions, illegal content or third-party confidential data without permission.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-soya-ink">Preview limits</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">Interfaces, models and quotas may change or be withdrawn during Preview. The service does not include arbitrary code execution, tool calls, billing, organization tenants, data residency, multi-region recovery or production support.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-soya-ink">Your content</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">You remain responsible for prompts and outputs and must have the rights needed to submit them. Content is sent to the managed inference upstream as described in the Privacy Notice. Verify model output before relying on it.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-soya-ink">Availability and access</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">The service is provided as-is and without uptime, support or fitness guarantees. SoyaOS may suspend keys or access to protect users, control cost, investigate abuse or end the Preview.</p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-8 text-xs text-soya-ink/50">
      These terms describe the Preview product boundary and remain subject to final launch approval.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
